          "The first question in onboarding task cleanup is not how fast the queue moves but whether the evidence supports the decision. CustomerSuccessManagers gives the customer success associate a defined intake step and the account owner a defined review point. Everything between those two points should leave a dated trace in the onboarding task cleanup log. When the trace is missing, the case is not ready for a decision even if a status field says otherwise."
