          "When onboarding task cleanup touches money, access, legal exposure, or a customer promise, the dependent action waits for the account owner. CustomerSuccessManagers records the pause reason and the time the issue was raised. The customer success associate routes the question instead of resolving it alone. That is not delay; it is the control working as designed. Leave the exception visible in the queue until an accountable owner has accepted the next action."
